> So...question 2....how do I keep the djinni and the marilith tame,
> given that they don't eat?? I have been very careful not to leave them
> behind for more than a turn.

Basically you make sure they don't lose tameness. Keep on the same level,
be careful with leashes and traps. If they do turn wild, you can only
retame them by magic.

